🌑 Void Elevated  ── #1A0A2E   ─── Card backgrounds (dark plum)
🌊 Joburg Teal    ─── #00D4AA   ─── Secondary accent (Indian Ocean)
💚 SA Green       ─── #007749   ─── Flag element / success
🌟 SA Gold        ─── #FFB81C   ─── Premium highlights / flag
❤️ SA Red         ─── #E03C31   ─── Flag stripe / errors
💙 SA Blue        ─── #002C6F   ─── Flag stripe / info
💜 Electric Indigo ── #4C1D95   ─── Deep purple surfaces
🩷 Hyper Crimson   ─── #FF2A6D   ─── Notifications / alerts
🟣 Neon Grape     ─── #9D4EDD   ─── Legacy alias (compat only)
```

