## 3. 🧱 Component Styles

### Buttons

**Primary Button (Purple Core)**
- Background: `--purple-core` (#6B21A8)
- Text: white (#FFFFFF)
- Border-radius: 8px
- Padding: 12px 24px
- Font: Outfit 16px, weight 600
- Hover: background shifts to `--grape-light` (#C084FC), subtle glow shadow
- Active: background shifts to `--grape-dim` (#581C87)
- Use: Main CTAs ("Get Started", "Generate Post", "Upgrade")

**Secondary Button (Ghost)**
- Background: transparent
- Text: `--text-primary` (#F5F0FF)
- Border: 1px solid `--border-default` (#2A1A3E)
- Border-radius: 8px
- Padding: 12px 24px
- Hover: background becomes `--void-hover` (#2E1A45), border becomes `--border-hover`
- Use: Secondary actions, "Learn More", "Cancel"

**Teal Accent Button**
- Background: `--joburg-teal` (#00D4AA)
- Text: `--cosmic-void` (#0D001A)
- Border-radius: 8px
- Padding: 10px 20px
- Font: Outfit 14px, weight 600
- Use: Special actions that need attention without being the main CTA

**Neon Glow CTA** *(premium variant)*
- Background: `--neon-glow` (#A855F7)
- Text: white
- Box-shadow: `.glow-purple` — multi-layer purple glow
- Border-radius: 8px
- Use: **Sparingly.** Only for the most important conversion actions

**Icon Button**
- Background: transparent
- Text: `--text-secondary`
- Border-radius: 8px
- Padding: 8px
- Hover: background `rgba(255,255,255,0.05)`
- Use: Toolbar actions, close buttons, settings triggers

**Danger Button**
- Background: `--mzansi-red` / `--sa-red` (#E03C31)
- Text: white
- Border-radius: 8px
- Use: Delete, destructive actions (rarely used)

### Cards & Containers

**Premium Card** (`.premium-card`)
- Background: layered gradient — dark plum to elevated surface
- Border: 1px solid `--border-default` (#2A1A3E)
- Border-radius: 16px
- Padding: 24px
- Shadow: deep black shadow + subtle purple edge glow
- Hover: border shifts to `#4A2570`, translateY(-2px), purple aura
- Use: **Primary card style.** Dashboard widgets, pricing cards, feature highlights

**Inset Card** (`.inset-card`)
- Background: darker gradient that sinks into the background
- Border: 1px solid `--border-subtle` (#1E1030)
- Border-radius: 16px
- Shadow: inset shadow for depth
- Use: Sidebar panels, secondary info, content that should feel "behind" the main surface

**Glass Card** (`.glass-card`)
- Background: subtle gradient with purple-teal tint
- Backdrop-filter: blur(24px)
- Border: 1px solid rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.12) — purple-tinted glass
- Border-radius: 16px
- Shadow: 0 8px 32px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3)
- Use: Hero overlays, feature showcases, premium hoverable sections

**Aerogel Card** (`.aerogel-card`) — *Legacy name, kept for compatibility*
- Same styling as `.glass-card`

**Modal / Dialog**
- Background: `--void-surface` (#24103A)
- Border: 1px solid `--border-default`
- Border-radius: 16px
- Overlay: `rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.7)` with backdrop-blur(8px)
- Max width: 560px (standard), 720px (large), 400px (small)
- Padding: 32px

### Inputs & Forms

**Text Input**
- Background: `rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03)`
- Text: `--text-primary`
- Border: 1px solid `--border-default` (#2A1A3E)
- Border-radius: 8px
- Padding: 12px 16px
- Font: Outfit 16px
- Focus: border becomes 1px solid `--neon-glow` / `--border-active` (#A855F7), subtle purple glow ring
- Placeholder: `--text-tertiary`
- Error: border becomes 1px solid `--mzansi-red`
- Disabled: opacity 0.5

**Select / Dropdown**
- Same styling as text inputs
- Chevron icon in `--text-tertiary`
- Dropdown options: `--void-surface` background

**Text Area**
- Same as text input, but with 4-row minimum height
- Resize: vertical only

### Badges & Tags

**Purple Badge**
- Background: `--grape-subtle`
- Text: `--grape-light` (#C084FC)
- Border-radius: 6px
- Padding: 4px 10px
- Font: Outfit 12px, weight 500
- Use: Feature labels, status indicators

**Success Badge (SA Green)**
- Background: `rgba(0, 119, 73, 0.15)`
- Text: `--sa-green` / `--mzansi-green` (#007749)
- Border-radius: 6px
- Use: Active, completed, verified

**Premium Badge (SA Gold)**
- Background: `rgba(255, 184, 28, 0.15)`
- Text: `--sa-gold` / `--mzansi-gold` (#FFB81C)
- Border-radius: 6px
- Use: Premium features, achievements, pro tier badges

**Error Badge (SA Red)**
- Background: `rgba(224, 60, 49, 0.15)`
- Text: `--sa-red` / `--mzansi-red` (#E03C31)
- Border-radius: 6px
- Use: Errors, failures, critical alerts

**Info Badge (SA Blue)**
- Background: `rgba(0, 44, 111, 0.15)`
- Text: `--sa-blue` / `--mzansi-blue` (#002C6F)
- Border-radius: 6px
- Use: Tips, info, onboarding hints

### Navigation

**Top Navigation Bar**
- Background: `rgba(13, 0, 26, 0.8)` with backdrop-filter: blur(20px)
- Border-bottom: 1px solid `--border-subtle`
- Height: 64px
- Logo: left-aligned, Syne font, `--purple-core` colour
- Links: Outfit 14px, weight 500, `--text-secondary`
- Active link: `--purple-core` colour with subtle underline indicator
- Hover: `--text-primary`
- CTA: Primary purple button (right-aligned)

**Sidebar Navigation** *(Dashboard)*
- Background: `--void-elevated` (#1A0A2E)
- Width: 260px (collapsed: 72px)
- Border-right: 1px solid `--border-subtle`
- Items: Outfit 14px, weight 500, `--text-secondary`
- Active item: `--purple-core` with subtle left border indicator
- Icons: 20px, consistent style (Font Awesome 6)
- Section headers: Outfit 11px, uppercase, `--text-quaternary`

