## 5. 💡 Glow & Shadow System

Purple Glow Social's signature effect is — you guessed it — **the glow**. But unlike the old single-layer glow, our new system offers multiple glow flavours for different contexts.

### Glow Effects

**Purple Glow** (`.glow-purple`) — for CTAs, featured cards
```
box-shadow:
  0 0 30px rgba(107, 33, 168, 0.4),
  0 0 60px rgba(107, 33, 168, 0.2),
  0 0 100px rgba(107, 33, 168, 0.1)
```

**Teal Glow** (`.glow-teal`) — for teal accent elements
```
box-shadow:
  0 0 30px rgba(0, 212, 170, 0.35),
  0 0 60px rgba(0, 212, 170, 0.15),
  0 0 100px rgba(0, 212, 170, 0.08)
```

**Gold Glow** (`.glow-gold`) — for premium/highlight elements
```
box-shadow:
  0 0 30px rgba(255, 184, 28, 0.3),
  0 0 60px rgba(255, 184, 28, 0.12)
```

**Subtle Glow** (`.glow-subtle`) — for hover states
```
box-shadow:
  0 0 20px rgba(107, 33, 168, 0.15),
  0 0 40px rgba(107, 33, 168, 0.06)
```

**Purple Text Glow** (`.glow-text-purple`) — for headings, hero text
```
text-shadow:
  0 0 10px rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.4),
  0 0 30px rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.2),
  0 0 60px rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.1)
```

**Gold Text Glow** (`.glow-text-gold`) — for premium highlighting
```
text-shadow:
  0 0 10px rgba(255, 184, 28, 0.35),
  0 0 30px rgba(255, 184, 28, 0.15),
  0 0 50px rgba(255, 184, 28, 0.08)
```

### Glow Orbs (Decorative Background Elements)

- `.glow-orb-purple` — Large blurry purple circle for hero backgrounds
- `.glow-orb-teal` — Teal glow orb
- `.glow-orb-gold` — Gold glow orb

### Shadow Elevations

| Level | Token | Shadow | Used For |
|-------|-------|--------|----------|
| 0 | `--shadow-none` | none | Flat surfaces, page background |
| 1 | `--shadow-sm` | `0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.2)` | Subtle card lift |
| 2 | `--shadow-md` | `0 4px 16px rgba(0,0,0,0.25)` | Standard cards |
| 3 | `--shadow-lg` | `0 8px 32px rgba(0,0,0,0.3)` | Elevated cards, dropdowns |
| 4 | `--shadow-xl` | `0 12px 48px rgba(0,0,0,0.35)` | Modals, popovers |
| 5 | `--shadow-glow` | `0 0 24px rgba(107,33,168,0.3), 0 4px 16px rgba(0,0,0,0.25)` | Premium glow elements |

### Text Gradients

- `.text-gradient-purple` — Purple gradient text (Syne headings)
- `.text-gradient-gold` — Gold gradient text (premium labels)
- `.text-gradient-sa` — SA flag colour gradient text (special use)
- `.text-gradient-teal` — Teal gradient text

### Background Gradients

- `.bg-gradient-sa` — SA flag colour gradient
- `.bg-gradient-purple-teal` — Purple-to-teal gradient

